menu "HAL demo configuration"

config HAL_DEMO_GPIO_PIN
    int "GPIO pin driven by the HAL demo"
    default 4
    help
      Physical GPIO pad driven by the demo through the portable HAL GPIO API
      (hal_gpio_init/hal_gpio_write/hal_gpio_deinit).  The value is the pad
      number on the target SoC; the portable HAL treats it as an opaque
      hal_pin_t and never assumes a specific pad.  Select a free pad on your
      board.  The default targets the repository's reference ESP32 target.

config HAL_DEMO_PWM_PIN
    int "PWM pin driven by the HAL demo"
    default 18
    help
      Physical pad driven by the demo through the portable HAL PWM API
      (hal_pwm_init/hal_pwm_set_duty/hal_pwm_force_inactive/hal_pwm_deinit).
      The value is the pad number on the target SoC; the portable HAL treats
      it as an opaque hal_pin_t and never assumes a specific pad.  Select a
      free output-capable pad on your board.  The default targets the
      repository's reference ESP32 target.

endmenu
